[{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0508","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0508.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-12428","title":"Google Chrome V8 类型混淆远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Google Chrome 的 V8 JavaScript 引擎存在类型混淆（Type Confusion）漏洞，属于 CWE-843 类型。远程攻击者可通过构造特制的 HTML 页面，诱使目标用户访问后触发 V8 引擎对对象类型判断错误，导致攻击者能够实现越界读写操作。该漏洞影响 Google Chrome 142.0.7444.59 之前的所有版本，以及基于 Chromium 的 Microsoft Edge 等浏览器。攻击者需要诱导用户点击恶意链接或访问恶意网页，成功利用后可实现任意内存读写，进而可能执行任意代码。CVSS 评分 8.8，危害等级高。Google 已在 Chrome 142.0.7444.59 版本中修复此漏洞。","severity":"HIGH","score":8.8,"aliases":["CVE-2025-12428"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-11-10T20:15:35Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:32:21Z","remediation":"立即将 Google Chrome 升级至 142.0.7444.59 及以上版本（通过 Chrome 设置 > 关于 Chrome > 自动检查更新）。使用 Microsoft Edge 的用户升级至 142.0.3595.53 及以上版本。Fedora 42 用户执行 sudo dnf update 更新至 chromium 142.0.7444.162。如无法立即更新，可禁用 JavaScript 作为临时缓解措施（Chrome 设置 > 隐私与安全 > 网站设置 > JavaScript > 禁止）。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-28T00:00:00Z","references":["https://chromereleases.googleblog.com/2025/10/stable-channel-update-for-desktop_28.html","https://issues.chromium.org/issues/447613211","https://github.com/dexterm300/cve-2025-12428-exploit-poc","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/be44b05b9428dc18bc0705cf60dd8d8640cd49b1/2025/CVE-2025-12428.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/95e02b73a69df169404c6b2708e1f8d0346744bc/cves/2025/12xxx/CVE-2025-12428.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/f167926487b7da90867c80cac87302a7f8196ec5/2025/12xxx/CVE-2025-12428.json","https://github.com/arschlochnop/VulnWatchdog/blob/78f6b1731532530a1ff639ea0b08b84d975b4e39/data/by-cve/CVE-2025-12428.md","https://github.com/sari3l/Poc-Monitor/blob/5fe4fb06582cbbd39c10cfbc884045e215a69cb5/2025/CVE-2025-12428.json","https://github.com/arschlochnop/VulnWatchdog/blob/78f6b1731532530a1ff639ea0b08b84d975b4e39/data/2025/CVE-2025-12428-dexterm300_cve-2025-12428-exploit-poc.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/e2322a1c7ec352a09ed3f56a28a4b08df0e6844e/SSVC/data/20