rray.c 文件中 ary_fill_exec 函数存在越界写入漏洞，攻击者通过操控该函数的 start 和 length 参数可触发越界写入，导致内存破坏。该漏洞为本地攻击向量（AV:L），需要低权限（PR:L），攻击者无需额外认证即可在本地利用。利用代码已公开，可导致本地低权限用户提升权限或在目标系统上执行任意代码。受影响范围为使用 mruby 3.4.0 版本的项目及嵌入了该版本 mruby 运行时的应用。官方已发布补丁 commit 93619f06dd378db6766666b30c08978311c7ec94，建议用户尽快升级至包含该补丁的版本以消除风险。\n\n<value>mruby 3.4.0 的 mrbgems/mruby-array-ext/src/array.c 文件中 ary_fill_exec 函数存在越界写入漏洞，攻击者通过操控该函数的 start 和 length 参数可触发越界写入，导致内存破坏。该漏洞为本地攻击向量（AV:L），需要低权限（PR:L），攻击者无需额外认证即可在本地利用。利用代码已公开，可导致本地低权限用户提升权限或在目标系统上执行任意代码。受影响范围为使用 mruby 3.4.0 版本的项目及嵌入了该版本 mruby 运行时的应用。官方已发布补丁 commit 93619f06dd378db6766666b30c08978311c7ec94，建议用户尽快升级至包含该补丁的版本以消除风险。","severity":"LOW","score":1.9,"aliases":["CVE-2025-12875"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-11-07T21:15:40Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:33:07Z","remediation":"升级 mruby 至 3.5.0 或更高版本，该版本已包含修复补丁（commit 93619f06dd378db6766666b30c08978311c7ec94）。若通过包管理器安装，执行 `gem update mruby` 或更新系统 mruby 包。若从源码编译，请从 mruby 官方仓库拉取 3.5.0 标签及以上版本重新编译。临时缓解措施：限制对 mruby 运行时环境的本地访问权限，避免不可信用户执行 mruby 代码。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-28T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/makesoftwaresafe/mruby/commit/93619f06dd378db6766666b30c08978311c7ec94","https://github.com/mruby/mruby/","https://github.com/mruby/mruby/issues/6650","https://github.com/mruby/mruby/issues/6650#event-20443453808","https://github.com/mruby/mruby/issues/6650#issuecomment-3430851605","https://vuldb.com/?ctiid.331511","https://vuldb.com/?id.331511","https://vuldb.com/?submit.680879","https://github.com/rubysec/ruby-advisory-db/blob/c221da6ee7ac6efea6da2b8688d02b3da99eef23/rubies/mruby/CVE-2025-12875.yml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/d01cc3b51c3d46ca313e02b941d9469d580d931b/cves/2025/12xxx/CVE-2025-12875.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/e915181af7dd076dfb8cf6b313390a5810798769/2025/12xxx/CVE-2025-12875.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/c52ed49b018fbc876ac3a1cc53b206d35c44adb8/SSVC/data/2025/CVE-2025-12875.json","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/54b256cb2952e60dcd1a90ef7455fbfb2b786625/vex/cve/2025/CVE-2025-12875.json","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/54b256cb2952e60dcd1a90ef7455fbfb2b786625/osv/cve/2025/UBUNTU-CVE-2025-12875.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/c52ed49b018fbc876ac3a1cc53b206d35c44adb8/CVE/data/2025/CVE-2025-12875.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2025/CVE-2025-12875.json","https://github.com/neuvector/vul-source/blob/ada0c6c45d02a82e11f6f46403716f0946c37f98/ubuntu-cve-tracker/active/CVE-2025-12875","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2025-12875.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0540.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0539","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0539.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-12863","title":"Libxml2 libxml2 命名空间释放后使用漏洞","description":"libxml2 的 xmlSetTreeDoc() 函数在 tree.c 中处理跨文档节点移动时存在命名空间释放后使用（CWE-416）漏洞。当调用 xmlAddChild() 或 xmlReplaceNode() 将带有命名空间的节点从源文档移动到目标文档时，xmlNodeSetDoc() 会递归更新节点的 doc 指针，但未同步更新 node->ns 命名空间指针，导致其悬挂指向已释放的源文档命名空间内存。攻击者可通过构造包含命名空间的 XML 文档并触发跨文档节点移动操作，在源文档销毁后对目标节点执行序列化，从而触发堆内存释放后使用，可能导致拒绝服务或远程代码执行。该漏洞影响所有使用 libxml2 解析和操作 XML 文档的应用程序，但 CVE-2025-12863 已被美国国家漏洞数据库（NVD）判定为无效并正式拒绝分配。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2025-12863"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-11-07T21:15:40Z","updated":"2025-11-20T15:17:23Z","remediation":"立即升级 libxml2 至 v2.15.3 或更高版本（v2.14.x 用户升级至对应修复版本），该版本重写了 xmlSetTreeDoc() 函数以修复命名空间释放后使用漏洞。升级后需重新编译链接 libxml2 的应用程序。若无法立即升级，可在 XML 解析时禁用命名空间处理（设置 XML_PARSE_NOBLANKS 标志并避免跨文档移动带命名空间的节点）作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-28T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/f38c5fdc2d5ae016cb5ff615cdaf3941dc98e9f4/cves/2025/12xxx/CVE-2025-12863.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/279583be34c6d843b0dc5c18439662dc1902e505/2025/12xxx/CVE-2025-12863.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/205083faf6b3f186002bb501f7178bdd84048b96/CVE/data/2025/CVE-2025-12863.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2025/CVE-2025-12863.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2025-12863.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/b4e8e071ec72e458e6fba462e799cbd376c49627/CVE-2025/CVE-2025-128xx/CVE-2025-12863.json","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/54b256cb2952e60dcd1a90ef7455fbfb2b786625/osv/cve/2025/UBUNTU-CVE-2025-12863.json","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/54b256cb2952e60dcd1a90ef7455fbfb2b786625/vex/cve/2025/CVE-2025-12863.json","https://github.com/neuvector/vul-source/blob/ada0c6c45d02a82e11f6f46403716f0946c37f98/ubuntu-cve-tracker/retired/CVE-2025-12863","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/1838da7604055c8895f6f79e31255e78a27012a4/2025/CVE-2025-12863.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0539.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0441","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0441.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-10966","title":"curl wolfSSH SFTP 后端缺少主机验证漏洞","description":"该漏洞存在于 curl 的 SSH 连接管理代码中，当使用 wolfSSH 后端进行 SFTP 操作时，缺失主机验证机制。这导致 curl 无法在 SSH 连接期间检测到 man-in-the-middle (MITM) 攻击者。攻击者可利用这一漏洞在用户与目标 SSH/SFTP 服务器之间插针，窃取用户凭证并潜在获取敏感数据。该漏洞影响使用 curl 执行 SFTP 文件传输操作的场景，尤其当 SFTP 后端采用 wolfSSH 时更为严重。尽管 CVSS 评分仅为 4.3（中等风险），但其潜在影响不容忽视，可能导致 SSH 连接被劫持，危及传输数据的安全性和用户隐私。攻击者通过提供虚假主机密钥即可触发该漏洞，系统将无法验证服务器真实身份，从而允许未经授权的连接建立。这一安全缺陷暴露了 wolfSSH 在主机验证方面的系统性不足，需要在代码中强制实施严格的主机密钥验证和指纹验证流程。未修复的 curl 版本将继续暴露用户到 SSH/SFTP 连接过程中的安全风险，建议立即更新到包含安全补丁的版本并配置强壮的主机密钥验证机制以确保连接安全。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.3,"aliases":["CVE-2025-10966"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-11-07T08:15:39Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:29:21Z","remediation":"立即将 curl 升级至 8.17.0 及以上版本（该版本已移除 wolfSSH 后端支持）。如无法升级，重新编译 curl 时选择 libssh2 或 OpenSSH 等其他 SSH 后端替代 wolfSSH；或在应用层避免使用 sftp:// 协议，改用 scp 或其他文件传输方式作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["https://curl.se/docs/CVE-2025-10966.html","https://curl.se/docs/CVE-2025-10966.json","https://hackerone.com/reports/3355218","http://www.openwall.com/lists/oss-security/2025/11/05/2","https://cert-portal.siemens.com/productcert/html/ssa-253495.html","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/be44b05b9428dc18bc0705cf60dd8d8640cd49b1/2025/CVE-2025-10966.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/145038fbd12ba507a810d82f3ca7bed9554ecf9f/cves/2025/10xxx/CVE-2025-10966.json","https://github.com/curl/curl-www/blob/34a0654c7d690832cab13124c394a5a0cc433078/docs/CVE-2025-10966.md","https://github.com/neuvector/vul-source/blob/e9a4ab6839838576fc98bcb2ecd0e476425665f5/ubuntu-cve-tracker/retired/CVE-2025-10966","https://github.com/fluent/fluent-bit/blob/cb7256c2867494ae404ab6e3da936e8f6e0c9c94/lib/librdkafka-2.15.0/CHANGELOG.md","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/16901ed3086419e92a3d59446e25736507cf6a0b/2025/10xxx/CVE-2025-10966.json","https://github.com/reddelexc/hackerone-reports/blob/420e41078cd65f59f446c2dc4b337051e83055bc/docs/tops_by_program/TOPCURL.md","https://github.com/3kz2501/3kz_blog/blob/59370880a06b381c063ab200d3efef5016493e80/app/routes/posts/2025-11-07_CVE-2025-10966.mdx","https://github.com/alpinelinux/aports/blob/bf66e61ceed5e250997657c9323c46b0c5917025/main/curl/APKBUILD","https://github.com/CVEProject/cve-reference-ingest-data/blob/31d5b78ee7ad856a6aee490403faecefdc8a4878/references/CVE-2025-10966-2026-02-13-1005"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0441.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0496","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0496.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-12036","title":"Google Chrome V8 引擎越界内存访问漏洞","description":"Google Chrome 的 V8 JavaScript 引擎存在越界内存访问漏洞，源于 V8 对内存边界检查不充分。远程攻击者可通过构造特制的 HTML 页面诱导用户访问，触发越界读取操作，导致敏感信息泄露或内存破坏。该漏洞影响 Google Chrome 141.0.7390.122 之前版本及基于 Chromium 的 Microsoft Edge、Fedora 等衍生软件，CVSS 评分 8.8，危害等级高。用户需升级至 Chrome 142.0.7444.162 或安装对应安全更新以修复此漏洞。","severity":"HIGH","score":8.8,"aliases":["CVE-2025-12036"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-11-06T23:15:35Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:31:36Z","remediation":"立即升级 Google Chrome 至 141.0.7390.122 或更高版本（设置→关于 Chrome→检查更新），同时升级 Microsoft Edge 至 142.0.3595.53 或更高版本（设置→关于 Microsoft Edge→检查更新）。Linux 用户（Fedora 43）执行 sudo dnf update chromium 升级至 141.0.7390.122。若暂时无法升级，可在 Chrome 启动参数中添加 --js-flags=\"--jitless\" 禁用 JIT 编译作为临时缓解措施，并避免访问不受信任的网页。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-28T00:00:00Z","references":["https://chromereleases.googleblog.com/2025/10/stable-channel-update-for-desktop_21.html","https://issues.chromium.org/issues/452296415","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/0118bdf83d51e7ec6262ccd7acc694cb751b5bf8/cves/2025/12xxx/CVE-2025-12036.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/5f10816d455ad0d7b2a1abab6159b8d8e7afc3c8/2025/12xxx/CVE-2025-12036.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/6550296d9cb5b12971003dddc7912cdc0707af50/SSVC/data/2025/CVE-2025-12036.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/6550296d9cb5b12971003dddc7912cdc0707af50/CVE/data/2025/CVE-2025-12036.json","https://github.com/anchore/nvd-data-overrides/blob/4c26ebbfb2437ed90b3e4375ee155f638be2c4bd/data/2025/CVE-2025-12036.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2025/CVE-2025-12036.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2025-12036.json","https://github.com/anchore/cve-data-enrichment/blob/1c0dfd8c28507756be9a283d40cf1d9bdcdb241c/data/anchore/2025/CVE-2025-12036.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/