,"published":"2025-11-06T22:15:39Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:29:52Z","remediation":"立即将 Google Chrome 升级至 141.0.7390.54 及以上版本（通过 chrome://settings/help 检查更新并重启浏览器）。基于 Chromium 的浏览器（Edge、Brave、Opera 等）需同步更新至对应版本。Linux 发行版用户（如 Fedora）执行包管理器更新至 chromium 141.0.7390.122。无法立即升级时，可禁用不受信任的 HTML 页面渲染或使用 Site Isolation 功能缓解越界读取风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["https://chromereleases.googleblog.com/2025/09/stable-channel-update-for-desktop_30.html","https://issues.chromium.org/issues/441917796","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/be44b05b9428dc18bc0705cf60dd8d8640cd49b1/2025/CVE-2025-11211.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/2786c0581d3fd3239f3f8ab3739b9b784dba4433/cves/2025/11xxx/CVE-2025-11211.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/e1d7afb428742628d991f2465e712a059beb8d79/2025/11xxx/CVE-2025-11211.json","https://github.com/neuvector/vul-source/blob/ada0c6c45d02a82e11f6f46403716f0946c37f98/ubuntu-cve-tracker/retired/CVE-2025-11211","https://github.com/grafana/grafana-image-renderer/blob/0a918126b9e7fd11d49cb100c32a439da9d3d30d/CHANGELOG.md","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2025/CVE-2025-11211.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/c55392b715d0e2e1caa8bc26997a940be7494a13/advisories/unreviewed/2025/11/GHSA-p97f-m8c4-2pvc/GHSA-p97f-m8c4-2pvc.json","https://github.com/eslerm/ubuntu-cve-tracker/blob/f17e5ebf7a87347cc68d8fae347d07409a857342/retired/CVE-2025-11211","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/ad8af7b6d55e05f22d7ff67c808ccd8d54c89d32/CVE/data/2025/CVE-2025-11211.json","https://github.com/illuusio/freebsd-osv/blob/3234f9e67d0170ff9c6cada9a1f48f061b109728/md/2025/FreeBSD-2025-0308.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0454.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0453","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0453.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-11210","title":"Google Chrome Tab 侧信道信息泄露漏洞","description":"Google Chrome 141.0.7390.54 之前版本的 Tab 组件存在侧信道信息泄露漏洞。远程攻击者可通过构造特制的 HTML 页面，诱骗用户执行特定的 UI 手势操作，利用侧信道方式窃取页面布局或状态信息，进而实现 UI 欺骗攻击。该漏洞攻击复杂度低，无需特权，但需要用户交互，CVSS 评分 5.4，危害等级中危。Google 已在 Chrome 141.0.7390.54 版本中修复此漏洞。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.4,"aliases":["CVE-2025-11210"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-11-06T22:15:38Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:29:51Z","remediation":"立即将 Google Chrome 升级至 141.0.7390.54 或更高版本（最新稳定版为 141.0.7390.122），可通过 Chrome 菜单 > 帮助 > 关于 Google Chrome 自动检查更新。基于 Chromium 的浏览器（如 Microsoft Edge、Brave）用户应同步更新至对应修复版本。Fedora 43 用户执行 sudo dnf update chromium 升级至 141.0.7390.122。作为临时缓解措施，可在浏览器设置中禁用 JavaScript 或安装阻止第三方 UI 覆盖的扩展程序。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["https://chromereleases.googleblog.com/2025/09/stable-channel-update-for-desktop_30.html","https://issues.chromium.org/issues/440523110","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/be44b05b9428dc18bc0705cf60dd8d8640cd49b1/2025/CVE-2025-11210.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/2786c0581d3fd3239f3f8ab3739b9b784dba4433/cves/2025/11xxx/CVE-2025-11210.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/e1d7afb428742628d991f2465e712a059beb8d79/2025/11xxx/CVE-2025-11210.json","https://github.com/neuvector/vul-source/blob/ada0c6c45d02a82e11f6f46403716f0946c37f98/ubuntu-cve-tracker/retired/CVE-2025-11210","https://github.com/sec-dojo-com/cve-poc/blob/1c2e0105dfc8043b137c91cc2d5ac23317d19c53/pocs/2025/CVE-2025-11210.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/c55392b715d0e2e1caa8bc26997a940be7494a13/advisories/unreviewed/2025/11/GHSA-vqr5-h29q-9xvm/GHSA-vqr5-h29q-9xvm.json","https://github.com/eslerm/ubuntu-cve-tracker/blob/f17e5ebf7a87347cc68d8fae347d07409a857342/retired/CVE-2025-11210","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/ad8af7b6d55e05f22d7ff67c808ccd8d54c89d32/SSVC/data/2025/CVE-2025-11210.json","https://github.com/bmwiedemann/openSUSE/blob/d8a2873